Spec: SpecDD Path Reference Contributor

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Register SpecDD path references with IntelliJ.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceContributor.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceContributor.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceProvider.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references/SpecDDPathReferenceContributorBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Extend IntelliJ `@PsiReferenceContributor`.
  Register `@SpecDDPathReferenceProvider` for SpecDD PSI elements.
  Register references on the SpecDD PSI text token emitted by the minimal parser.

Must not:
  Resolve paths directly.
  Report diagnostics.
